{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53059","headline":"五言普门上人兰若一首 · 郎士元","name":"五言普门上人兰若一首","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"支公身欲老，常在沃[洲]（州）多。\n惠力堪传教，禅功久伏魔。\n山云随坐夏，幽草伴头陀。\n借问回心後，贤愚去几何？\n（按：《全唐诗》卷二四九收此诗爲皇甫冉作。\n然《唐诗卷》约在元和前後书，爲时甚早，故仍存之。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郎士元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53059.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53059","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}